# gl_INIT (configure.ac:337).
#
# `gnulib-tool` copied the `.m4` files for every module in the closure into
# `m4/`, and `m4/gnulib-comp.m4` invokes them all from `gl_INIT`.  The list
# below is exactly those files for which `@rules_cc_autoconf//gnulib/m4/`
# ships an implementation, so it stands in for the generated `gl_INIT` body
# rather than for any choice made here.  Left out because they are not gnulib
# configure macros: gnulib-comp itself, wget.m4 (written out below) and
# wget_manywarnings.  `strcase.m4` is the pre-split spelling of what the
# ports call `strcasecmp` and `strncasecmp`, so those two stand in for it,
# and this gnulib still handled stdckdint.h inline in gnulib-comp.m4, which
# the `stdckdint_h` port stands in for.
#
# These have to be explicit `deps`: the default autoconf toolchain already
# lists every one of them under `cache_deps`, but that only feeds the content
# cache used to skip duplicate checker actions.  Results reach a consumer's
# `CcAutoconfInfo` only through `deps`.
